# fix-sd-card verification part 2: a console MACL must power-cycle the SD
# slot (150 ms) and re-mount, and the machine must still boot discs after.
FAILON ERRFATAL
FAILON System malfunction
SENDCR
PAUSE 2
LABEL master clear - triggers the SD power cycle
SEND MACL
SENDCR
PAUSE 8
LABEL boot SINTRAN from 20500 octal after the power cycle
SEND 20500&
EXPECT 900 RUNNING
PAUSE 20
